# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum also documents these addons itself, mirrored here: [SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), [OBP](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp), [PNA](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna), [SLC](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc). All addons: [Advanced techniques - Qiskit addons](/guides/addons).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum גם מתעדת בעצמה את ה-addons האלה, והם משוקפים כאן: [SQD](/addons/qiskit-addon-sqd), [OBP](/addons/qiskit-addon-obp), [PNA](/addons/qiskit-addon-pna), [SLC](/addons/qiskit-addon-slc). כל ה-addons: [טכניקות מתקדמות - Qiskit addons](/guides/addons).\n"
